00:03:17,142 --> 00:03:23,142
The Daniel Craig story.

2
00:06:34,285 --> 00:06:40,285
Being James Bond is a documentary film directed by Baillie Walsh.

3
00:09:51,428 --> 00:09:57,428
Daniel Craig candidly reflects on his 15 year adventure as James Bond.

4
00:13:08,571 --> 00:13:14,571
Including never-before-seen archival footage from Casino Royale to the upcoming 25th film No Time To Die, Craig
shares his personal memories in conversation with 007 producers, Michael G Wilson and Barbara Broccoli.

5
00:16:25,714 --> 00:16:31,714
Self (voice), played by Daniel Craig.

6
00:19:42,857 --> 00:19:48,857
Self - Producer (voice), played by Michael G. Wilson.

7
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:06,000
Self - Producer (voice), played by Barbara Broccoli.

8
00:26:17,142 --> 00:26:23,142
Self (archive footage), played by Harrison Ford.

9
00:29:34,285 --> 00:29:40,285
Self (archive footage), played by Rami Malek.

10
00:32:51,428 --> 00:32:57,428
James Bond is a fictional character and the titular protagonist of Eon Productions'
rebooted James Bond film series, first introduced in the 2006 film Casino Royale.

11
00:36:08,571 --> 00:36:14,571
Portrayed by British actor Daniel Craig, this interpretation of the character, and the actor portraying him, received critical praise for a "caustic,
haunted, intense reinvention of 007" – a darker, more realistic tone than the lighter characterisations portrayed in past Bond films.

12
00:39:25,714 --> 00:39:31,714
The rebooted series spanned five films—Casino Royale (2006), Quantum of Solace (2008),
Skyfall (2012), Spectre (2015), and No Time to Die (2021)—all starring Craig.

13
00:42:42,857 --> 00:42:48,857
This version of Bond is killed at the end of the lattermost film, making him, to date, the
only version of the character in the Eon Productions James Bond films to die.
